flowchart TD
  A["multichain-util create iovchain"] --> B["edit params.dat<br/>block time 2 s, ports 7447/7446,<br/>mining-diversity 0.5, mine-empty-rounds -1"]
  B --> C["multichaind iovchain (TA)<br/>genesis block"]
